    "object": {
      "Graph": {
        "@Type": "f8a58466",
        "@Value": {
          "Implementation": {
            "@Type": "3b83b776",
            "@Value": {
              "TextDocument": {
                "@Type": "f3878285",
                "@Value": {
                  "TextBlobForSerialisation": "(string)head := free;\n\nIF head <> CONS_NIL THEN\n\tfree := cdr(head);\n\trplaca(head, CONS_NIL);\n\trplacd(head, CONS_NIL);\nEND_IF\n\nget := head;\n",
                  "LineInfoPersistence": "(string)cd8547ed-c64f-4666-8e63-4823ffa878f3_Impl_LineIds"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "Interface": {
            "@Type": "a9ed5b7e",
            "@Value": {
              "TextDocument": {
                "@Type": "f3878285",
                "@Value": {
                  "TextBlobForSerialisation": "(string)(*\n================================================================================\nFunction Block Method : ConsHeap.get\n\nPurpose:\n    Removes and returns the first available cell from the free list.\n\nApplication:\n    Call to allocate an available cell before populating it.\n\nOperation:\n    1. Reads the free-list head.\n    2. Advances the free-list head to the selected cell's cdr.\n    3. Clears the selected cell's car and cdr.\n\nInputs:\n    None.\n\nOutputs:\n    None.\n\nInOut:\n    None.\n\nReturn Value:\n    CONS_REG - Allocated cell register, or CONS_NIL when the free list is\n    empty.\n\nAssumptions:\n    - FB_Init has populated the free list.\n\nLimitations:\n    - Returns CONS_NIL without an error indication when no cells are\n      available.\n\nDependencies:\n    - ConsHeap.cdr, ConsHeap.rplaca, and ConsHeap.rplacd.\n    - CONS_NIL.\n\nExample:\n\n    crCell := fbConsHeap.get();\n\nRevision History:\n    ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    Date         Version  Author           Description\n    ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    13/11/2026   1.0      CannyIEC         Documented existing behaviour\n    ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\n================================================================================\n*)\nMETHOD get : CONS_REG\nVAR\n\thead : CONS_REG;\nEND_VAR\n",
                  "LineInfoPersistence": "(string)cd8547ed-c64f-4666-8e63-4823ffa878f3_Decl_LineIds"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "TypeInfos": {
        "3b83b776": "{3b83b776-fb25-43b8-99f2-3c507c9143fc}",
